msgid "vtkVoronoiCore.h/.txx"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/add-voronoi-framework.md:32
msgid "vtkVoronoiCore2D.h/.txx"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/add-voronoi-framework.md:33
msgid "vtkVoronoiCore3D.h/.txx"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/add-voronoi-framework.md:34
msgid "vtkVoronoiTile.h/.cxx"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/add-voronoi-framework.md:35
msgid "vtkVoronoiHull.h/.cxx"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/add-voronoi-framework.md:38
msgid "Filters"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/add-voronoi-framework.md:40
msgid ""
"The filters provide basic capabilities to generate the Voronoi tessellation "
"in 2D and 3D, as well as unconstrained Delaunay triangulations. Options "
"exist to produce output in different forms, for example boundary meshes, "
"unstructured grids, and surface nets can be generated."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/add-voronoi-framework.md:45
msgid "The filter classes consist of:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/add-voronoi-framework.md:47
